{
  "zq19a01": "Let me go,",
  "zq19a02": "and I'll tell you who pushed you.",
  "zq19a03": "I'll find the truth myself.",
  "zq19a04": "You dare!",
  "zq19a05": "You scrubbed,",
  "zq19a06": "still red, huh?",
  "zq19a07": "Qian says you evaded tax.",
  "zq19a08": "Do you confess?",
  "zq19a09": "Sir,",
  "zq19a10": "check his hands.",
  "zq19a11": "It's from dyeing cloth,",
  "zq19a12": "so what?",
  "zq19a13": "Then Lai San shows his too.",
  "zq19a14": "I-I don't know anything…",
  "zq19a15": "Careful what you say.",
  "zq19a16": "Stay quiet,",
  "zq19a17": "and he'll dump you too.",
  "zq19a18": "Into Qian's house—",
  "zq19a19": "who opened the lock?",
  "zq19a20": "The one red to the wrist.",
  "zq19a21": "Proof?",
  "zq19a22": "Why me?",
  "zq19a23": "Proof? Right here.",
  "zq19a24": "Qian house ledger,",
  "zq19a25": "the seventh: five taels to Lai San.",
  "zq19a26": "Sir,",
  "zq19a27": "she found this.",
  "zq19a28": "It…",
  "zq19a29": "I told him to burn it.",
  "zq19a30": "Qian, the arsonist,",
  "zq19a31": "pays a hundred taels!",
  "zq19a32": "Mission complete.",
  "zq19a33": "The day you fell in the river,",
  "zq19a34": "ask your own family.",
  "zq19a35": "Don't listen to him.",
  "zq19a36": "He offered the truth,",
  "zq19a37": "you didn't trade.",
  "zq19a38": "Justice",
  "zq19a39": "isn't for trade.",
  "zq19a40": "In court,",
  "zq19a41": "you left me out.",
  "zq19a42": "All three: affection past twenty.",
  "zq19a43": "Rewards: sugar refining, troop drills…",
  "zq19a44": "Ducks… against locusts?",
  "zq19a45": "Main quest: win the realm's hearts.",
  "zq19a46": "If someone came to take me,",
  "zq19a47": "would you let them?"
